      {
       "text": "Hey Players!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve just rolled out a small patch to improve your experience in PBBGU. Here’s what’s included in this update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Exit Option: Added the option to Exit the game by pressing the cancel button while in the title menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve been working on these tweaks based on your feedback and we're truly grateful for them. As always, thanks so much for your continued support, and we’ll keep improving the game with your suggestions in mind!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy gaming,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
